+
+Kernel changes confined to `src/models/glm5_next/kernels/rocm/kernels_batch.{hip.cpp,hpp}`
+(launcher grid/threads inside the same file); `executor.cpp` and the
+tokenwise path needed no change — `FfnBlock` still delegates to
+`FfnBlockBatch`, so tokenwise remains the same kernel family by construction.
+
+## Next-phase pointers
+
+- `BatchQuantTiledKernel` is now 56.2% of slice kernel time (736 ms/chunk)
