+Target: `BatchF32TiledKernel` (F32 dense projections: KDA ssm f_a/f_b/g_a/
+g_b/beta, DSA kv_a, indexer k/comp_gate/q_b/proj, MoE router, hc.fn), the
+family the brief puts at 29% of pair kernel time / 6541 ms per 2048 tokens /
+37 GB/s = 15% of the read ceiling, with a 128x weight re-read (122 GB per
+1024-chunk from 8-token tiles) and a 6541 → ≤2200 ms mandate. Prototype:
+`tools/bench/f32_ws_bench.hip` (V0 verbatim + weight-stationary restructures
+in double and float, real per-rank shape set, twin/xdispatch identity
+checks, small-n sweep, f64/f32 FMA peaks), built with
