+**Outcome: the relaxation is taken.** The double-accumulation contract was
+the binding constraint, with the full evidence chain below; both kernel
+twins switched to float accumulation together with a weight-stationary
+re-tile, the family drops **6531 → 996 ms per 2048 tokens on the pair
+(6.56x**, mandate was 2.5x), slice 842 → **1084 tok/s**, pair probe
+89.2 → **116.8 tok/s**. Every gate re-ran green; chunked-vs-tokenwise byte
+identity holds by construction (same kernels, both widths) and was verified
+byte-exact at 513 x3 / 2052 / 2049; the indexer top-k selection arithmetic
+is untouched and still double.
