+# GLM-5.3-Flash TP2 prefill 250 tok/s — vLLM review + weights-once attack plan (2026-10-10, phase 1)
+
+Study-only review of `davidcanar/vllm-strix-halo` (cloned read-only at
+`/root/vllm-strix-halo`, pin `fe5ac10`, 2026-10-06; its container / OdinLink /
+RCCL stack was **never executed** on this pair) plus a re-derived weights-once
+roofline for gufo's three weight-moving kernel families. No functional source
+changes this phase; the only tree delta is this file.
+
+## 1. What vLLM achieves on the same silicon, and how they measure
+
+Same hardware target: 2× Strix Halo (gfx1151 / Radeon 8060S), TP=2 over
+Thunderbolt-4. Their stack: vLLM `73859fec` on ROCm 10 / torch 2.11, GLM-5.3-
+Flash **AWQ W4A16** checkpoint, DFlash2 k=3 spec decode, PIECEWISE CUDA
+graphs, **8192-token prefill chunks**, KV pin 16 GiB, 512K context (§44, §45).
+
+**Measured GLM prefill (§44, cold prefix):**
+
+| prompt length | prefill tok/s |
+| ---: | ---: |
+| 5.8 K | 291–294 |
+| 11.5 K | 281–282 |
+| 19.9 K | 278 |
