+i.e. 3.40–3.60 ms/token end-to-end through HTTP. README "Known issue 3"
+attributes the profile: **routed-expert MoE = 41.5 % of prefill GPU time at
+12–18 % of achievable FLOPS** with M ≈ 65 k routed rows per chunk (8192
+tokens × top-8) — the expert weights are effectively weight-stationary at
